    "ambiguity_notes": "All occurrences of a marker color jointly define one bounding box; markers need not be outside the gray region. The output first restores the complete bounding rectangle of every gray cell, then applies colors 1 through 9 in numeric order (skipping gray), so a higher color overwrites a lower color where their clipped rectangles overlap.",
