      "Do not project each marker independently or only toward its nearest gray corner.",
      "Do not preserve marker cells outside the gray bounding rectangle.",
      "Do not require marker colors to lie outside the gray region.",
      "Do not resolve overlapping colored rectangles by marker position or encounter order; numeric color order governs."
    ],
